{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/create_containment.py","reason":"new pure-decision containment primitive: after a create returns a key, record known key on the still-pending entry (record_pending_key+save) BEFORE the canonical label, then label, then optional property, then bind_confirm last; any failure returns a typed safety_aborted known-key abort that retains the keyed-pending binding and never deletes the remote issue"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_containment.py","reason":"held-out TDD: recording Cloud/DC fakes proving the write-ahead ordering (key-before-label), property-failure visibility that cannot erase the label, facade-only persistence, known-key preserved on every post-create failure, no remote delete seam, and confirmation gating later intents"}]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1787700796695573001,"uuid":"03fdb4b8-17fe-4666-8021-7d6fa41ab559"}